OL,4,C'Diabolical' copper cable crime making 
OL,5,Clife a misery                          
OL,6,GCriminal gangs are striking under the  
OL,7,Gcover of darkness to steal copper      
OL,8,Gcables, causing misery across Britain  
OL,9,Gwith delays to trains and disruption   
OL,10,Gto broadband and landline phones.      
OL,12,FTelecommunications, railways, electric 
OL,13,Fvehicle charging stations and power    
OL,14,Fnetworks are among the sectors that    
OL,15,Fhave been targeted, fuelled by rising  
OL,16,Fcopper prices.                         
OL,18,FInfrastructure provider Openreach said 
OL,19,Fthieves had even returned to steal     
OL,20,Fcable just yards from where its        
OL,21,Fengineers had been replacing stolen    
OL,22,Fsections of cabling.              G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
