OL,4,CArson ruled out after Grand Burstin    
OL,5,CHotel fire                             
OL,6,GInvestigators have ruled out arson as  
OL,7,Gthe cause of a large fire at a         
OL,8,Glandmark seaside hotel, Kent Police    
OL,9,Ghas said.                              
OL,11,FTwo people arrested in connection with 
OL,12,Fa blaze at the Grand Burstin Hotel in  
OL,13,FFolkestone will face no further action 
OL,14,Fafter "no criminal cause" was found,   
OL,15,Faccording to the force.                
OL,17,FAbout 280 people from the hotel and 90 
OL,18,Fpeople from neighbouring flats had to  
OL,19,Fevacuate when flames took hold in the  
OL,20,Fearly hours of 19 September.           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
