OL,4,CMan arrested after police officer's    
OL,5,Cneck cut                               
OL,6,GA man has been arrested after an       
OL,7,Gincident in Peacehaven which saw an    
OL,8,Gofficer have his neck and face cut,    
OL,9,Gpolice say.                            
OL,11,FSussex Police said officers were       
OL,12,Fcalled to an address in South Coast    
OL,13,FRoad at about 10:05 GMT on Friday      
OL,14,Fafter receiving a report of a man      
OL,15,Fmaking threats to kill.                
OL,17,FThe officer was injured while trying   
OL,18,Fto detain a man at the scene and his   
OL,19,Finjuries were not thought to be        
OL,20,Fserious, but he was taken to hospital  
OL,21,Ffor treatment, the force said.         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
