OL,4,CCost of 1,500-home regeneration        
OL,5,Cproject increases                      
OL,6,GA major regeneration project which     
OL,7,Gincludes 1,500 new homes has had an    
OL,8,Gadditional #198.7m added to its        
OL,9,Gbudget, after councillors were told    
OL,10,Gcost increases were down to factors    
OL,11,G"outside the council's control".       
OL,13,FThe budget increase takes the total    
OL,14,Fcost of the project to #527.6m.        
OL,16,FWhen completed, Guildford Borough      
OL,17,FCouncil's Weyside Urban Village        
OL,18,Fproject will see much of the Slyfield  
OL,19,Findustrial estate transformed.         
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
